ly:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}.langs{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto 0;font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted)}.langs a{color:var(--lapis)}</style>\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-ER9F5C2HC1\"></script>\n<script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments)}gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-ER9F5C2HC1',{allow_google_signals:false,allow_ad_personalization_signals:false});</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/44.html\">Surah Ad-Dukhaan</a> › Ayat 58</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ad-Dukhaan 44:58</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَإِنَّمَا يَسَّرْنَاهُ بِلِسَانِكَ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَذَكَّرُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sungguh, Kami mudahkan Al-Qur`an itu dengan bahasamu agar mereka mendapat pelajaran.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقوله: {ولقد يسرنا القرآن للذكر} أي لأجل الذكر كما قال: {فإنما يسرناه بلسانك لعلهم يتذكرون}<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/194</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s44a58\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/44-56.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (44:56)</a></div></main><nav class=\"langs\" aria-label=\"Language\">🌐 <a href=\"/ayah/44-58.html\" hreflang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" data-l=\"ar\">العربية</a> · <a href=\"/en/ayah/44-58.html\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" data-l=\"en\">English</a> · <a href=\"/ur/